  "description": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\n👑 This is Kingdom! 👑\n=\nA gaming community unique of its kind.\n\nQuality over quantity!\n\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\n🏆Achievements🏆\n=\n**🥇#1 Guild (Leaderboard)**\n\n**🥇Winner of Seasons: 1, 2, 3, 7, 8**\n\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\n⚜️ Our Guilds ⚜️\n=\n🔹**Kingdom**\n\n🔹**Kingdom II**\n\n🔹**Kingdom III**\n\n🔹**Kingdom IV**\n\n🔹**Kingdom V - cursed guild (Kingdom exclusive)**\n\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\n⏩ JOIN REQUIREMENTS ⏪\n=\n👉 **Active daily.**\n\n👉 **Full participation in Guild Raids.**\n\n👉 **Contribution to Guild Challenges.**\n\n👉 **Combat Level 92.**\n\n👉 **Mandatory use of Discord.**\n\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\n⚔️ RAID TIMES ⚔️\n=\n📯 **4:00 PM UTC.** 📯\n\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\n✅ APPLY ON DISCORD NOW ✅\n=\nIf you wish to join our fam, applications **must** be done through discord: \n\n🎯 **https://discord.com/invite/74cfseKHcq** 🎯\n\n\nIn-game only applications will **not** be considered. \n\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐\n\nWelcome to Kingdom! 🔥🔥🔥🔥\n=\n\n⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐",
